<title>USA: H.F. Ahmanson OKs stock purchase of $250 mln.</title>
<headline>H.F. Ahmanson OKs stock purchase of $250 mln.</headline>
<dateline>IRWINDALE, Calif. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>H.F Ahmanson &amp; Co Monday said its board has authorized a new program to buy $250 million more of its common stock, after an existing program is completed.</p>
<p>At September 30, HF Ahmanson had bought 13 million common shares, or 11 percent of its outstanding common at an average of $24.36, the company said. The company had 105.5 million shares outstanding at September 30.</p>
<p>Including the latest plan, the company said, it will have authorized $825 million to buy common stock and retire high cost preferred stock since October 1995.</p>
</text>
